WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.382 --> 00:00:02.216
- I heard she was in the London gang.

00:00:02.216 --> 00:00:04.521
- I heard her brother and
sister ran off together.

00:00:04.521 --> 00:00:06.257
- I heard she got thrown
out of her British college

00:00:06.257 --> 00:00:07.303
for drug use.

00:00:07.303 --> 00:00:09.720
(soft music)

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:31.099
- Hey.

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:32.912
Aren't you that transfer student?

00:00:32.912 --> 00:00:33.745
Didn't you get--

00:00:33.745 --> 00:00:35.745
- No, no, that's not me.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:39.725
- Okay, cool.

00:00:39.725 --> 00:00:42.392
(intense music)

00:00:51.519 --> 00:00:54.019
(phone dings)

00:01:03.924 --> 00:01:05.424
- I said no, June.

00:01:12.921 --> 00:01:13.754
(sighs)

00:01:13.754 --> 00:01:15.587
How is this happening?

00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:20.743
(scattered chatter)

00:01:28.165 --> 00:01:29.064
I'm so sorry.

00:01:29.064 --> 00:01:30.033
Oh my god, I'm such an idiot.

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.116
I'm so sorry.

00:01:32.759 --> 00:01:33.592
(sighs)

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:34.552
- He likes working too much.

00:01:34.552 --> 00:01:37.052
- Wait, is that Bridget alone?

00:01:39.106 --> 00:01:40.538
- Bridge.

00:01:40.538 --> 00:01:41.371
- Hey.

00:01:41.371 --> 00:01:42.204
- Hey.

00:01:42.204 --> 00:01:43.073
- Where have you been?

00:01:43.073 --> 00:01:44.233
I've been texting you.

00:01:44.233 --> 00:01:45.384
- Yeah, I know.

00:01:45.384 --> 00:01:46.747
Just been busy.

00:01:46.747 --> 00:01:48.081
- Is everything okay?

00:01:48.081 --> 00:01:50.590
- Yeah, you can tell us.

00:01:50.590 --> 00:01:53.322
- You know, I'm just really
over being gossiped about.

00:01:53.322 --> 00:01:55.583
I just want to get along with people here.

00:01:55.583 --> 00:01:57.360
- Yeah, sucks.

00:01:57.360 --> 00:01:58.437
It'll be okay though.

00:01:58.437 --> 00:02:00.372
It happened to me, too.

00:02:00.372 --> 00:02:02.391
People don't know you,
so you're an easy target,

00:02:02.391 --> 00:02:04.438
and they like to talk, but I promise,

00:02:04.438 --> 00:02:06.272
everybody is going to get bored soon.

00:02:06.272 --> 00:02:07.754
- Yeah, no, this shit
happened to me all the time

00:02:07.754 --> 00:02:08.643
in high school.

00:02:08.643 --> 00:02:10.479
My dad moved abroad for work,

00:02:10.479 --> 00:02:12.342
and people started this rumor that he

00:02:12.342 --> 00:02:14.054
had a secret family over there.

00:02:14.054 --> 00:02:14.945
It was so weird.

00:02:14.945 --> 00:02:17.471
- Oh, apparently I dealt crack.

00:02:17.471 --> 00:02:18.560
I was 14.

00:02:18.560 --> 00:02:21.416
- I worked in a fetish club at 16.

00:02:21.416 --> 00:02:22.449
Not even legal.

00:02:22.449 --> 00:02:24.193
- I ate my twin in the womb.

00:02:24.193 --> 00:02:25.496
- I believe that.

00:02:25.496 --> 00:02:27.573
- But seriously though,
just like, I promise

00:02:27.573 --> 00:02:28.593
this will all pass.

00:02:28.593 --> 00:02:33.459
And we know that none of these
things are true, obviously.

00:02:33.459 --> 00:02:34.503
Bridget?

00:02:34.503 --> 00:02:35.949
- No, there's no truth.

00:02:35.949 --> 00:02:37.466
It's all bullshit.

00:02:37.466 --> 00:02:38.299
You want to get a drink?

00:02:38.299 --> 00:02:39.790
Let's get a drink.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:42.207
(soft music)

